"<b>Copyright Match Tool</b><br>As of {date2}, over <b>{copyrightmatchtoolaccesscount} channels have access</b>  to the tool. It automatically detects copies of their content uploaded to other channels."],["transparencyReport.youtubecopyright.summary.SectionTitle1Component3ParagraphText","<b>Content ID</b><br>Our solution for those with the most complex rights management needs (such as movie studios, record labels, and collecting societies) - <b>over 8,900 partners have access</b>. Although they represent the smallest number of users for any of our tools, claims from Content ID partners represent over <b>99% of all copyright actions</b> on YouTube, totalling <b>over 950 million claims</b> in the first half of 2023. In the first half of 2023, rightsholders chose to monetize <b>over 90%</b> of all Content ID claims."],
["transparencyReport.youtubecopyright.summary.SectionTitle1Component3ParagraphTextV6","<b>Content ID</b><br>Our solution for those with the most complex rights management needs (such as movie studios, record labels, and collecting societies) - <b>over {accessparterncount} partners had access</b> between {date1} and {date2}. Although they represent the smallest number of users for any of our tools, claims from Content ID partners represent over <b>99% of all copyright actions</b> on YouTube, totalling <b>over {contentidclaimcount} claims</b> between {date1} and {date2}. Between {date1} and {date2}, rightsholders chose to monetize <b>over 90%</b> of all Content ID claims."],
["transparencyReport.youtubecopyright.summary.SectionTitle1Component3ParagraphTextV7","<b>Content ID</b><br>Our solution for those with the most complex rights management needs (such as movie studios, record labels, and collecting societies) - <b>over {accessparterncount} partners had access</b> as of {date1}. Although they represent the smallest number of users for any of our tools, claims from Content ID partners represent over <b>99% of all copyright actions</b> on YouTube, totalling <b>over {contentidclaimcount} claims</b> in {year1}. In {year1}, rightsholders chose to monetize <b>over 90%</b> of all Content ID claims."],
["transparencyReport.youtubecopyright.summary.SectionTitle1Component3ParagraphTextV8","<b>Content ID</b><br>Our solution for those with the most complex rights management needs (such as movie studios, record labels, and collecting societies) - <b>over {accessparterncount} partners had access</b> as of {date1}. Although they represent the smallest number of users for any of our tools, claims from Content ID partners represent over <b>99% of all copyright actions</b> on YouTube, totalling <b>over {contentidclaimcount} claims</b> in {year1}. In {year1}, rightsholders chose to monetize <b>over 90%</b> of all Content ID claims."],
["transparencyReport.youtubecopyright.summary.SectionTitle2Component0ParagraphHeader","We take steps to prevent abuse or otherwise invalid use of our rights management tools."],["transparencyReport.youtubecopyright.summary.SectionTitle2Component0ParagraphText","<ul><li>Over 6% of videos requested for removal through the public webform in the first half of 2023 were the subject of abusive copyright removal requests (i.e., these requests were assessed by our team as a likely false assertion of copyright ownership).<li>10 times higher attempted abuse rate in webform than in copyright removal tools with limited access</ul>"],
["transparencyReport.youtubecopyright.summary.SectionTitle2Component0ParagraphTextV6","<ul><li>Over 6% of videos requested for removal through the public webform between {date1} and {date2} were the subject of abusive copyright removal requests (i.e., these requests were assessed by our team as a likely false assertion of copyright ownership).<li>10 times higher attempted abuse rate in webform than in copyright removal tools with limited access</ul>"],["transparencyReport.youtubecopyright.summary.SectionTitle2Component0ParagraphTextV7",
"<ul><li>Over 6% of videos requested for removal through the public webform in {year1} were the subject of abusive copyright removal requests (i.e., these requests were assessed by our team as a likely false assertion of copyright ownership).<li>10 times higher attempted abuse rate in webform than in copyright removal tools with limited access</ul>"],["transparencyReport.youtubecopyright.summary.SectionTitle2Component1ParagraphHeader","We give uploaders the means to assert their rights."],["transparencyReport.youtubecopyright.summary.SectionTitle2Component1ParagraphText",
